Ogham’s CSS vertical-script entry is:

| Script | Transform | Vertical intrinsic direction |
|---|---:|---|
| Ogham (`Ogam`) | −90° clockwise | `btt` (bottom-to-top) |

CSS Writing Modes cannot automatically handle Ogham with mixed vertical typesetting. For current Level 4 CSS, use:

```css
.ogham {
  writing-mode: vertical-lr;
  text-orientation: sideways-lr;
}
```

Earlier CSS guidance recommended:

```css
.ogham {
  writing-mode: vertical-lr;
  text-orientation: sideways-left;
}
```

This produces a line or paragraph running bottom to top.
